<title>UK: BayerHypo sets 200 bln lire 8-year structured bond.</title>
<headline>BayerHypo sets 200 bln lire 8-year structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiana SA, Cariplo and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  COUPON     *8.0     *MATURITY    07.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  100.40    PAY DATE  L-06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    98.70     L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN 20 PCT MINUS 2 TIMES</p>
<p>		 12-MONTH LIBOR IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
